{{Infobox crops |Name = Summer Spangle |image = Summer Spangle.png |alt = summerspangle |Release = February 26, 2016 |Growth = 8 Days |Season = Summer |Seed Name = Spangle Seeds |Seed Description = Plant these in the summer. Takes 8 days to grow. |Description = Pretty flower that only grows in Summer. |Energy = No Star: +45, Silver: +63, Gold: +81 |Health = No Star: +18, Silver: +25, Gold: +32 |Crop Pierre Sell = No Star: 90g, Silver: 112g, Gold: 135g |Seed Pierre Buy = 50g }}
Summer Spangle is a flower in [[Stardew Valley]]. They can be grown during the [[Summer]] and take 8 days to grow. They sell through the shipping container for: *No Star: 90g *Silver: 112g *Gold: 135g
==Gifting== The Summer Spangle is loved by [[Caroline]] and liked by most other [[villagers]] (except by [[Clint]], [[George]] and [[Sebastian]] that hate it).
{{NavboxCrop}}
[[pl:Letni błysk]] [[ru:Летний блестник]] [[uk:Літній блискун]]

{{Infobox crops |Name = Bok Choy |image = Bok Choy.png |Release = February 26, 2016 |Growth = 4 Days |Season = Fall |Seed Name = Bok Choy Seeds |Seed Description = Plant these in the Fall. Takes 4 days to produce. |Energy = No Star: +25, Silver: +35, Gold: +45 |Health = No Star: +10, Silver: +14, Gold: +18 |Crop Pierre Sell = No Star: 80g, Silver: 110g, Gold: 132g |Seed Pierre Buy = 50g |Seed Joja Buy = 62g }} '''Bok Choy''' is a [[crop]] in [[Stardew Valley]]. It can be grown during the [[Fall]] and take 4 days to mature. They sell through the [[shipping container]] for: *80g *Silver: 110g *Gold: 132g each. [[File:Bok Choy Growth.png|thumb|link=]] == Used In: == *[[Super Meal]] {{NavboxCrop}}
[[Category:Items]] [[Category:Crops]] [[Category:Farming]]
[[pl:Kapusta chińska]] [[ru:Бок-чой]] [[uk:Бок-чой]]

{{Infobox crops |Name = Fairy Rose |image = Fairy Rose g.png |alt = Fairyrose |Release = February 26, 2016 |Growth = 12 Days |Season = Fall |Seed Description = Fairy Rose Seed |Description = An old folk legend suggests that the sweet smell of this flower attracts fairies. |Energy = No Star: +45, Silver: +63, Gold: +81 |Health = No Star: +18, Silver: +25, Gold: +32 |Crop Pierre Sell = No Star: 319g, Silver: 362g, Gold: 435g |Seed Pierre Buy = 200g |Seed Joja Buy = 250g }}
Fairy Rose is a flower in [[Stardew Valley]]. It can be planted during the [[Fall]] and takes 12 days to grow.
==Gifting== Favorite of [[Evelyn]] and [[Jas]].
{{NavboxCrop}}
[[Category:Plants]] [[Category:Fall crops]]
[[pl:Bajeczna róża]] [[ru:Сказочная роза]] [[uk:Казкова троянда]]

{{Stub}}
'''Qi Fruit''' is a [[crop]] that is [[farmed]] and harvested for the [[Qi's Crop]] special order quest, started in [[Qi's Walnut Room]]. It is grown from [[Qi Bean]]s, which can only be found on [[Ginger Island]] while the quest is active. Both Qi Beans and Qi Fruit will disappear when the quest ends.
[[Category:Items]] [[Category:Crops]] [[Category:Farming]]

{{Infobox crops |Name = Cranberries |image = Cranberry.png |alt = Cranberry |Release = February 26, 2016 |Growth = |Season = Fall |Seed Name = Cranberry Seeds |Seed Description =Plant these in the fall. Takes 7 days to mature, and continues to produce after first harvest. |Description = These tart red berries are a traditional winter food. |Energy = Normal: +38, Silver: +53, Gold: +68 |Health = Normal: +15, Silver: +21, Gold: +27 |Crop Pierre Sell = Normal: 130g, Silver: 162g, Gold: 195g |Seed Pierre Buy = |Seed Pierre Sell = |Seed Joja Buy = |name = Cranberries |season = Fall }} {{Stub}} '''Cranberries''' are a [[crop]] grown in [[Fall]] from [[Cranberry Seeds]]. They mature after 7 days and keep producing the [[fruit]] every 5th day.
