{{Starbox crop|crop=Parsnip|image=parsnip.png|description=A spring tuber closely related to the carrot. It has an earthy taste and is full of nutrients.|type=crop|season=Spring|seed=Parsnip Seeds|energy=25|health=11|quality=y|sellvalue=35}} {{tocright}} '''Parsnip''' is a crop in Stardew Valley. This is one of the most basic crops in the game. They can be grown during the Spring and take 4 days to mature.
